      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}\n\nI'd like a billboard shader that I can confidently use and that looks good on mobile devices.\n\nI think billboard shaders are widely used, but the ones I've come across have some kind of flaw and are very difficult to use.\n\nIf VRC officially provided a perfect billboard shader, I think it would be useful for world and avatar creation.\n\nI think it would be a lot of fun if they also provided shaders for imposters.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-09-06T01:39:11.255Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to request the addition of a billboard shader that works on VRC Mobile, mainly for trees, foliage, and particle effects.\n\nIdeally, it would support 8-face and 16-face options, and include the ability to disable roll for better visual stability.\n\nIn addition, for avatar creators, I would like to request that the VRC Impostor system be opened up so that users can create their own impostors.\n\nThis would allow creators to better optimize avatars and reduce performance costs, while still maintaining visual quality.\n\n木や葉、パーティクルなどに使えるビルボードシェーダーを、VRCモバイルでも利用できるようにしてほしいです。\n\n可能であれば、8面・16面に対応し、ロールをオフにできる機能があると望ましいです。\n\nさらに、アバター制作者向けの要望として、VRCのインポスターシステムをユーザーが自作できるようにしてほしいです。\n\nこれにより、アバターをより効率的に最適化し、パフォーマンスコストを下げつつ、ビジュアル品質を保つことができるようになります。",
